@startuml
title History refresh: missing XML and recovery
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB
skinparam noteBorderColor #D97706
hide footbox

actor "Maintainer" as owner
collections "Aggregation workspace\nOne pipeline cohort" as files
participant "Selection verification" as selection
participant "History refresh" as refresh

files -> selection : Complete baseline + planned + actual manifests
selection --> files : coverage.json / HTML: PASSED
files -> refresh : Same baseline + previous TSV\nOne node's XML is missing
note right of refresh
  Two-node example: minimumCoverage = 1.0.
  One family can still be measured;
  valid selections do not prove XML delivery.
end note
refresh --> files : FAILED: MINIMUM_COVERAGE\nWrite JSON; remove stale candidate TSV
owner -> files : Restore missing XML from the original cohort\nKeep indexed paths and maintained history
files -> refresh : Repeat only the artifact aggregation
note right of refresh
  No compilation, tests or plan regeneration.
  Changed XML invalidates old task results;
  Configuration Cache can still be reused.
end note
refresh --> files : PASSED: deterministic candidate TSV + JSON
files --> owner : Review the candidate for a later history commit
note over owner,refresh
  Require native test outcomes independently.
  A new test run forms a new timing cohort.
end note
@enduml
